  "releaseNotes": "--APR 2026: Refactored IO helpers (DirectoryHelper, FileHelper, DriveHelper, FileProcessor, TempFileManager) for performance, added SocketsHelper.ConnectTcpAsync and HttpClientHelper.GetStreamAsync, added Win32 RegistryHelper, and enabled trimming support.\n\t  --MAY 2026: Switched FileHelper to a static HttpClient, optimized PathHelper invalid-char checks with cached separators, and cached XmlSerializer in ServiceHelper.\n\t  --JUN-JUL 2026: Refactored HTTP event listeners, added HttpClientOptions, improved logging, and fixed service and HTTP regressions.\n\t  --AUG 2026: Added FileHelper/DirectoryHelper IsFileOrFolder API, refactored TempFileManager to use ConcurrentDictionary, and updated HttpClientHelper metadata.\n\t  --OCT 2026: Added IsFileOrFolder API to FileHelper and DirectoryHelper, refactored TempFileManager to use ConcurrentDictionary for improved thread safety, marked HttpClientHelper API as stable, and updated OpenTelemetry.Api dependency to 1.18.0.",
